{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792770720, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T15:52:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T15:53:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792770780, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:52:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25539, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市樹木被砍少了很多，該如何增加都市綠化環境？", "display_name": "中山代表 No.25,539", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:52:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1921, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北交通規劃混亂\n外地開車來常常不知道怎麼開\n道路一下天橋一下地上\n看導航也常常錯過\n繞來繞去的", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.1,921", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:52:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39656, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "經濟", "content": "洪申翰一直保護外勞，外勞想換雇主隨時可換，雇主更換外勞空窗期很多卻很久。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.39,656", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:52:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11353, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "街道上常有老鼠和蟑螂蠻行，希望環境衛生能改善", "display_name": "松山代表 No.11,353", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:52:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13930, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "人行道能夠好好重整統一，巷子違停汽車加強取締，綠色人行道的做法不美觀並且容易更多違停還是沒地方走", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.13,930", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 1921, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.1,921", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 39656, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.39,656", "district": "shilin", "is_repla